From: Omarchy Pi source-port candidate
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] vcsm: bind live buffer retirement to original service

NONDEPLOYABLE ownership subset: successful buffer retirement only.
Uncertain IMPORT and setup-error ownership remain acceptance blockers.
No firmware-wide reset/drain guarantee is claimed.

